OL,3,GNEWSAFire stations face reduced cover
OL,4,Aunder new plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FFourteen fire stations across the West
OL,7,FMidlands could be affected by proposed
OL,8,Fcuts to front-line fire cover.
OL,10,FThe proposals include closing and
OL,11,Frelocating Ward End Fire Station in
OL,12,FBirmingham, removing night-time cover
OL,13,Fat Bloxwich, Willenhall and Kings
OL,14,FNorton, and reducing the overnight
OL,15,Favailability of second fire engines at
OL,16,Fup to 11 other stations.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
