OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAFire stations face reduced cover
OL,4,Aunder new plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Fire Brigades Union (FBU) warned
OL,7,Fthat the changes could harm public
OL,8,Fsafety and cited the wildfires that
OL,9,Foccurred in parts of the region,
OL,10,Fincluding in Willenhall, over the
OL,11,Fsummer.
OL,13,FHowever, West Midlands Fire Service
OL,14,Fsaid no decisions had been made and
OL,15,Fchanges were needed to reprioritise
OL,16,Fcover.
